request one idempotent 50% partial reduction of CURRENT held quantity. Before wallet mutation, compare the requested order notional with the symbol's current Binance NOTIONAL/MIN_NOTIONAL floor from exchangeInfo. If it is below the Binance minimum, or the minimum cannot be obtained safely, execute nothing and continue normal management; never promote the partial harvest to a larger/full sell. Persist position state, best price, bearish streak, last evaluated 1m signal and actual harvested quantity. Keep cumulative allocatedPositionPercent unchanged so future progressive targets permanently reserve the harvested exposure gap.",behavior:"Intentional Production behavior change after entry only. BUY qualification, trade frequency, entry sizing, existing TP/SL/profit-lock/normal exit authority and their priority remain unchanged. Near-TP runs last and cannot act on missing/stale evidence. Production and Replay also share the Binance minimum-executable-notional guard; a below-minimum 50% harvest is skipped with an explicit server log and the position continues unchanged. Remaining quantity continues under existing management. The partial SELL remains in the wallet ledger/realized-P&L truth but is excluded from CLOSED-position queries so it cannot masquerade as a completed trade. Replay executes the same shared policy and records partial SELL/P&L without closing the shadow position.",regression:"Verify missing/stale 1m/5m never harvests; a single bearish 1m does not harvest; two distinct fresh bearish 1m signals plus lost 5m support can confirm; fresh 5m BUY/STRONG_BUY blocks; recovery inside the 20% rejection boundary resets persistence; TP extension/progressive add resets pre-harvest Near-TP geometry; duplicate execution key cannot sell twice; paper_position quantity/P&L stays synchronized; Replay exact/fallback paths preserve partial proceeds/P&L and keep the position open."},
